### Arm A: one const fn body, two call sites
args     site               da     outcome
200,100  const context      on     REFUSED error[E0080]
200,100  call at runtime    on     PANIC attempt to add with overflow
200,100  const context      off    value const 44
200,100  call at runtime    off    run 44

### N1, the runtime half compiles at both profiles
  PASS
### N2, the same body with arguments that do not overflow
  const   da=on   const 255
  runtime da=on   run 255
  const   da=off  const 255
  runtime da=off  run 255
  PASS, both sites produce a value at both profiles

### Arm B: can a const expression observe the build profile?
  debug-assertions=on:
    const saw debug_assertions = true
    run   saw debug_assertions = true
  debug-assertions=off:
    const saw debug_assertions = false
    run   saw debug_assertions = false
### N3, the two halves of arm B must agree with each other
  PASS, they agree at both profiles

